    <title>v1.18.0-rc1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pre-release for flight testing, &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.px4.io/main/en/releases/1.18&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;full release notes can be found here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixes since beta2:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimator: correct sequential fusion and external-position reset-by-fusion (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5181952850&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28273&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28273/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28273&quot;&gt;#28273&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5213321062&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28326&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28326/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28326&quot;&gt;#28326&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5246154013&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28379&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28379/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28379&quot;&gt;#28379&lt;/a&gt;), refresh range-height fusion timeouts (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5187151997&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28283&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28283/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28283&quot;&gt;#28283&lt;/a&gt;), and avoid failover to an instance with failing innovation test ratios (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5343129652&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28533&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28533/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28533&quot;&gt;#28533&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multicopter: prevent zero hover-thrust estimates, now enforcing a 10% floor (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5237600656&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28365&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28365/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28365&quot;&gt;#28365&lt;/a&gt;); reset stale terrain-hold state (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5132369000&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28231&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28231/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28231&quot;&gt;#28231&lt;/a&gt;); bypass velocity filtering when the requested cutoff cannot be applied (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5343129806&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28534&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28534/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28534&quot;&gt;#28534&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VTOL: preserve multicopter mode through mission RTL (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5263479106&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28399&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28399/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28399&quot;&gt;#28399&lt;/a&gt;), correct tailsitter fixed-wing heading (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5408028599&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28656&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28656/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28656&quot;&gt;#28656&lt;/a&gt;), and allow fixed-wing external-mode registration while in multicopter form (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5345941647&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28542&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28542/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28542&quot;&gt;#28542&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigation: return to overshot, unreached waypoints (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5270291133&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28409&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28409/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28409&quot;&gt;#28409&lt;/a&gt;), handle position resets during mission takeoff, and stop reporting mission completion as a storage failure (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5343583847&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28537&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28537/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28537&quot;&gt;#28537&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control allocation: stopped-motor NaNs no longer contaminate unallocated thrust and torque feedback (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5312313920&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28489&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28489/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28489&quot;&gt;#28489&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home position and battery: correct barometric-filter time units (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5343129956&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28535&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28535/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28535&quot;&gt;#28535&lt;/a&gt;), preserve analogue battery-filter state across parameter updates (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5343583675&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28536&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28536/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28536&quot;&gt;#28536&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DroneCAN: fix SocketCAN transmit loss/reordering (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5237391836&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28363&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28363/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28363&quot;&gt;#28363&lt;/a&gt;), NuttX 10.3 FlexCAN transmission (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5247909277&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28381&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28381/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28381&quot;&gt;#28381&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5260222849&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28393&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28393/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28393&quot;&gt;#28393&lt;/a&gt;), and transmit-queue accounting and diagnostics (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5261516060&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28395&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28395/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28395&quot;&gt;#28395&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5261934415&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28397&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28397/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28397&quot;&gt;#28397&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAN node updates: block firmware updates while armed; arming is blocked by default while updates are pending or a node goes offline mid-update (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4989951030&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28089&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28089/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28089&quot;&gt;#28089&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Input validation: reject invalid ST24 packet lengths (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5285947572&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28450&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28450/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28450&quot;&gt;#28450&lt;/a&gt;) and oversized MAVLink TUNNEL payload declarations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5369013106&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28575&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28575/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28575&quot;&gt;#28575&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Runtime: fix USB MAVLink startup and reconnect handling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5157603575&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28250&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28250/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28250&quot;&gt;#28250&lt;/a&gt;), ensure DDS read requests are created (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5243225114&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28375&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28375/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28375&quot;&gt;#28375&lt;/a&gt;), and run performance-counter callbacks outside the global list mutex (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5270444839&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28411&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28411/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28411&quot;&gt;#28411&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensors: correct InvenSense gyro scaling, IIM42653 full-scale reporting (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5054026980&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28133&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28133/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28133&quot;&gt;#28133&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5085369416&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28177&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28177/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28177&quot;&gt;#28177&lt;/a&gt;), and IIS2MDC data-ready handling, sensitivity and sampling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4944131407&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28016&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28016/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28016&quot;&gt;#28016&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ESC telemetry: resynchronise serial responses (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5123611823&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28223&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28223/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28223&quot;&gt;#28223&lt;/a&gt;) and decode EDT current in 1 A steps (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5062583234&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28143&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28143/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28143&quot;&gt;#28143&lt;/a&gt;). Older AM32 firmware using half-amp encoding reports current twice as high until updated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boards: FMUv6X BMP581 fallback (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5265599037&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28401&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28401/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28401&quot;&gt;#28401&lt;/a&gt;), FMUv6X-RT UART receive buffers and FRAM erase fixes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5280090344&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28431&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28431/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28431&quot;&gt;#28431&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5208487658&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28312&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28312/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28312&quot;&gt;#28312&lt;/a&gt;), and corrected NXP MR-Tropic DShot timing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firmware size and packaging: reduce parameter-constructor flash usage, restoring Corvon 743v1 headroom without removing features (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5209828998&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28320&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28320/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28320&quot;&gt;#28320&lt;/a&gt;); include flashable CAN-node and FMU bootloader binaries in release assets (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5284070927&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28446&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28446/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28446&quot;&gt;#28446&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5315227379&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28496&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28496/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28496&quot;&gt;#28496&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/compare/v1.18.0-beta2...v1.18.0-rc1&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v1.18.0-beta2...v1.18.0-rc1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
