  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/5298790/v1.18.0-beta2</id>
    <updated>2026-08-09T04:44:58Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/releases/tag/v1.18.0-beta2"/>
    <title>v1.18.0-beta2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pre-release for flight testing, &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.px4.io/main/en/releases/1.18&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;full release notes can be found here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixes since beta1:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed-wing: NaN eas2tas from zero-airspeed division in lat/lon control (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5009840796&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28107&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28107/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28107&quot;&gt;#28107&lt;/a&gt;), tailsitter false quadchute from wrong attitude frame (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4834392849&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27834&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27834/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27834&quot;&gt;#27834&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QGC compatibility regressions from stricter command validation: multicopter guided takeoff, camera mission items, and VTOL landing patterns are accepted again (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4848698839&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27853&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27853/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27853&quot;&gt;#27853&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4969298886&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28079&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28079/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28079&quot;&gt;#28079&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SD card read corruption on STM32H7 boards fixed via NuttX SDMMC cache coherency (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4964413586&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28071&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28071/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28071&quot;&gt;#28071&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parameter storage: FMUv6X-RT FRAM multi-page writes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5031680402&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28127&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28127/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28127&quot;&gt;#28127&lt;/a&gt;), flashparams compaction moved to boot (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4994278233&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28093&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28093/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28093&quot;&gt;#28093&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FMUv6X-RT: boot-time FlexSPI DLL calibration, fixing load-dependent hardfaults (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5060635870&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28141&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28141/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28141&quot;&gt;#28141&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimator: external position estimate hard reset while aiding is active (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4852787078&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27856/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27856&quot;&gt;#27856&lt;/a&gt;), DroneCAN rangefinder out-of-range readings no longer fused as terrain (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4919631997&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27963&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27963/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27963&quot;&gt;#27963&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigation: DO_JUMP set as current mission item is resolved to its target (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4957858125&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28063&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28063/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28063&quot;&gt;#28063&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Battery: unknown time-remaining no longer trips RTL (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4901155549&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27929&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27929/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27929&quot;&gt;#27929&lt;/a&gt;), coulomb counting uses unclamped dt (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4858694259&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27866&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27866/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27866&quot;&gt;#27866&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commander: COM_PARACHUTE warning-only mode (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4887093748&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27903&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27903/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27903&quot;&gt;#27903&lt;/a&gt;), multicopter autotune can re-trigger without reboot (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4846384368&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27851&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27851/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27851&quot;&gt;#27851&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VOXL2 / Qurt platform: implement px4_task_join (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4875684146&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27886&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27886/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27886&quot;&gt;#27886&lt;/a&gt;), Hexagon NaN comparison fixes (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4904380223&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27931&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27931/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27931&quot;&gt;#27931&lt;/a&gt;), startup stdout TLS race (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4941093650&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28013&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28013/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28013&quot;&gt;#28013&lt;/a&gt;), keepalive file directory (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4951746504&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28053&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28053/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28053&quot;&gt;#28053&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GPS: RTCM corrections and moving-baseline data split into separate uORB topics (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4272641594&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27097&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27097/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27097&quot;&gt;#27097&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MAVLink: receive thread stack right-sized (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5029614108&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28124&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28124/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28124&quot;&gt;#28124&lt;/a&gt;); FMUv4 (Pixracer) configs right-sized for flash margin, dropping UAVCAN, uXRCE-DDS, mag bias estimator, and SIH from the default build (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5029614108&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/28124&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28124/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/28124&quot;&gt;#28124&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boards: CUAV X25-mega uses the renamed heater sensor ID parameter (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4844867739&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/issues/27846&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27846/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/27846&quot;&gt;#27846&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/compare/v1.18.0-beta1...v1.18.0-beta2&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v1.18.0-beta1...v1.18.0-beta2&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
